	"<header>Goto</>\n<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> or <hl>Drag</>\n<hl>Shift+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> to queue\n\nMove to this object or location and attempt to <hl>interact</>.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> to set the movement distance.": "<header>Ir para</>\n<Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> ou <hl>Arrastar</>\n<hl>Shift+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> para enfileirar\n\nMova-se para este objeto ou local e tente <hl>interagir</>.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> para definir a distância de movimento.", // <temporary automatic translation>
	"Store": "Armazenar",
	"<header>Store</>\n<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> or <hl>Drag</>\n\nSet to an owned <hl>unit</> or <hl>building</> to transfer inventory when possible.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> to set the minimum transfer amount.": "<header>Armazenar</>\n<hl>Ctrl+</><Key action=\"ExecuteAction\" style=\"hl\"/> ou <hl>Arrastar</>\n\nDefina para uma <hl>unidade</> ou <hl>edifício</> de sua propriedade para transferir o estoque quando possível.\n\nUse <Key id=\"MOUSEWHEELAXIS\" style=\"hl\"/> para definir a quantidade mínima de transferência.", // <temporary automatic translation>
